"Strangers are people you have no chat with yet. Their first message waits as a request: you choose to accept or block. They don't see that you read it." = "陌生人是你还没有聊天的人。他们的第一条消息会作为请求等待：由你选择接受或屏蔽。他们看不到你是否已读。";
