"Turn on App lock" = "打开应用锁";
"This is the old phone" = "这是旧手机";
"This is the new phone" = "这是新手机";
"Password (at least 10 characters)" = "密码（至少 10 个字符）";
"Repeat the password" = "再次输入密码";
"Include photos and voice notes" = "包括照片和语音消息";
"1 · Make a transfer file" = "1 · 生成迁移文件";
"The file holds your identity, chats and contacts, locked with this password. Without it nobody can open the file, not even us. Nothing is uploaded: you choose where the file goes." = "文件包含你的身份、聊天和联系人，并用此密码锁定。没有密码任何人都无法打开，包括我们。不会上传任何内容：文件去向由你决定。";
"Make the file" = "生成文件";
"Send the file to the new phone" = "将文件发送到新手机";
"Send it with AirDrop or save it to Files. When the new phone works, erase this one: the same identity on two phones confuses delivery." = "用隔空投送发送或保存到“文件”。新手机正常后，请抹掉这部手机：同一身份在两部手机上会扰乱送达。";
