"Done. This phone now has your identity and chats." = "完成。此手机现在拥有你的身份和聊天。";
"Replace everything on this phone?" = "替换此手机上的所有内容？";
"The identity, chats and settings here are replaced by the ones in the file." = "此处的身份、聊天和设置将被文件中的内容替换。";
"Wrong password, or the file is damaged." = "密码错误或文件已损坏。";
"This is not a Nearsend transfer file." = "这不是 Nearsend 迁移文件。";
