"Say hi, or agree where to meet." = "打个招呼，或约好见面地点。";
"Bluetooth connects you to Nearsend phones nearby, with no Wi-Fi, no cell signal and no internet." = "蓝牙让你连接附近的 Nearsend 手机，无需 Wi-Fi、蜂窝信号或互联网。";
"Battery saver is on: Nearsend looks for phones less often while you are connected. Messages may arrive a little later." = "省电模式已开启：已连接时 Nearsend 会降低搜索手机的频率。消息可能会稍晚送达。";
"Low Power Mode is on: Nearsend looks for phones less often while you are connected. Messages may arrive a little later." = "低电量模式已开启：已连接时 Nearsend 会降低搜索手机的频率。消息可能会稍晚送达。";
"Low battery: Nearsend looks for phones less often while you are connected. Messages may arrive a little later." = "电量低：已连接时 Nearsend 会降低搜索手机的频率。消息可能会稍晚送达。";
"In the background iPhone slows Bluetooth down, and nothing works after you swipe the app away. Leave it open in the background." = "在后台 iPhone 会减慢蓝牙，划掉应用后将无法工作。请让它在后台保持打开。";
"Recommend Nearsend Chat to the person next to you." = "把 Nearsend Chat 推荐给身边的人。";
"Scan with the camera" = "用相机扫描";
"Share link" = "分享链接";
