"Demo mode" = "演示模式";
"Shows sample people and chats, so you can try the app without another phone. Bluetooth is off while it is on; your own chats come back when you turn it off." = "显示示例联系人和聊天，无需另一部手机即可试用应用。开启期间蓝牙关闭；关闭后你自己的聊天会恢复。";
